              <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><img src="undefined/resources/images/monster-parts/head.png" alt="head" class="h-8 w-8 shrink-0"><span class="font-semibold">Head</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-10 w-10 text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-600">
